From 5a3708270afd2ed1f2de8c5b39f5d9130000021 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aster Browser <aster@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add a one-tap Aster release update check

Add an update action to Aster's Android new-tab page. It checks the public
GitHub latest-release API, selects the APK for the device ABI, compares the
release with the Aster version embedded in this build, and queues the APK in
Android DownloadManager. Installation remains subject to Android's normal
unknown-source and package-installer confirmations.
